  "DivisionNotes": [
    "This is a model-checking wrapper around LamportMutex. It introduces a CONSTANT MaxNat and a NatOverride operator (0..MaxNat) used in TLC's CONSTANT/CONSTANTS override mechanism to make Nat finite.",
    "NatOverride is a ValueDef (returns a finite range, not a Boolean predicate or action).",
    "No Variables, Init, Next, or temporal properties are defined locally; these are inherited from LamportMutex via EXTENDS.",
    "Listed in OperatorOverrides because the operator's intended use is to override the built-in Nat at model-checking configuration time."
